## Test Data Management

### 1. Mock Data Generation
```python
def create_mock_ct_volume():
    """Tạo CT volume giả cho testing"""
    # Tạo phantom với density variations
    volume = np.ones((64, 64, 32)) * -100  # Air baseline

    # Add tissue regions
    volume[20:44, 20:44, 10:22] = 50   # Soft tissue
    volume[28:36, 28:36, 14:18] = 1000  # Bone

    return volume.astype(np.int16)
```

